{"page":{"id":"fd284f6e-50f6-4840-9a7d-187cad05b67e","theme":"lord-of-the-rings","slug":"/lord-of-the-rings","canonical_url":"https://www.tonolore.com/lord-of-the-rings","title":"The Lord of the Rings","meta_title":"The Lord of the Rings (The Lord of the Rings) — Work, lore & connections | Ton-o-Lore","meta_description":"The Lord of the Rings is an epic high fantasy novel written by J.R.R. Tolkien, which was later fitted as a trilogy. The story began as a sequel to Tolkien's…","content":"<section class=\"intro\">\n    <p class=\"lead\">\n        The Lord of the Rings is an epic high fantasy novel written by <a href=\"/lord-of-the-rings/jrr-tolkien\" class=\"entity-link\">J.R.R. Tolkien</a>, which was later fitted as a trilogy. The story began as a sequel to Tolkien&#039;s earlier fantasy book , and soon developed into a much larger…\n    </p>\n\n    \n    <p>\n        Key threads from this canonical page lead to\n        <a href=\"/lord-of-the-rings/one-ring\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>The One Ring</strong></a>, <a href=\"/lord-of-the-rings/jrr-tolkien\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>J.R.R. Tolkien</strong></a>, <a href=\"/lord-of-the-rings/shire/frodo-baggins\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Frodo Baggins</strong></a>, <a href=\"/lord-of-the-rings/war-of-the-ring\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>War of the Ring</strong></a>, <a href=\"/lord-of-the-rings/movies\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Middle-earth Movies</strong></a> and <a href=\"/lord-of-the-rings/books\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Middle-earth Books</strong></a>.\n        Each link is another long-tail path through the subject.\n    </p>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"overview format-hubs\">\n    <h2>Explore by medium</h2>\n    <p>\n        Open the format-specific shelves — movies, games, manga, shows, and more —\n        each with their own long-tail pages.\n    </p>\n    <ul class=\"format-hub-list\">\n        <li><a href=\"/lord-of-the-rings/books\" class=\"entity-link\">Middle-earth Books</